# Corpus fixtures under tests/data are parsed and byte-compared by the tests. Git's EOL
# normalisation (autocrlf on Windows checks out LF as CRLF) would rewrite them and break the
# byte-exact round-trip assertions, so pin them verbatim — identical on every platform. GMAT
# script and GmatFunction sources are pinned the same way wherever they live.
tests/data/** -text
*.script -text
*.gmf -text
